{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2022-12-06 07:30:00', 'title': 'FMC CORPORATION AND MICROPEP TECHNOLOGIES ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC COLLABORATION TO CO-DEVELOP BIOHERBICIDE SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'COLLABORATION ACCELERATES DEVELOPMENT OF NEW MICROPEPTIDE-BASED BIOHERBICIDES TARGETING RESISTANT WEEDS. PHILADELPHIA , DEC. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC), A LEADING GLOBAL AGRICULTURAL SCIENCES COMPANY, AND MICROPEP TECHNOLOGIES (MICROPEP), A GLOBAL LEADER IN MICROPEPTIDE TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC COLLABORATION TO DEVELOP BIOLOGICAL SOLUTIONS TO CONTROL DESTRUCTIVE HERBICIDE-RESISTANT WEEDS THAT REDUCE CROP YIELDS.'}